    "description": "<p>They simply act, and success flows through that action. This Charm may be purchased once for each iteration of First The Ebon Dragon Excellency the character knows. While active, So Speaks The Ebon Dragon allows an Infernal to use its prerequisite as an innate power rather than a Charm activation. If the Infernal also knows the appropriate Effortless The Ebon Dragon Dominance, he can choose whether to pay the full cost of the Excellency to wield it innately or use it as a Charm to enjoy the cost reduction. The same rules apply if any other effects reduce the Excellency's cost.</p>",
